# Excel Introduction Practice

## Objective

Learn the basic Excel interface and understand how workbooks,
worksheets, rows, columns and cells are organized.

## Practical Exercise

Created a Pinterest Analytics workbook containing:

- Raw Pinterest performance data
- Practice worksheet
- Notes worksheet

## Concepts Practiced

- Workbook
- Worksheet
- Rows
- Columns
- Cells
- Cell references
- Data entry
- Basic Excel navigation
- Saving and reopening workbooks

## Dataset

The practice dataset represents Pinterest content performance,
including:

- Pin
- Category
- Impressions
- Engagements
- Saves
- Outbound Clicks

## File

`Pinterest_Excel_Basics.xlsx`